sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Quan tri vien
    participant FE as Frontend<br/>(Next.js)
    participant BE as Backend<br/>(VouchersController + VouchersService)
    participant Vouchers as MongoDB (vouchers)

    Note over Admin,Vouchers: LIST — GET /vouchers (chi Admin)
    Admin->>FE: Chon bo loc: trang thai, tu khoa, trang
    FE->>BE: GET /vouchers?status=ACTIVE&search=SALE&page=1&limit=20
    Note over BE: status co the la:<br/>ACTIVE  — chua het han + con luot dung<br/>EXPIRED — expiredAt <= now<br/>USED_UP — usedCount >= usageLimit<br/>DELETED — deletedAt != null
    BE->>Vouchers: find(filter).sort({ createdAt: -1 }).skip(skip).limit(limit)
    BE->>Vouchers: countDocuments(filter)
    Vouchers-->>BE: [data], total
    BE-->>FE: 200 { data, page, totalPages, totalItems }
    FE-->>Admin: Hien thi danh sach voucher
